            "__typename": "AttractionsProduct",
            "additionalInfo": "Infants must have a child ticket and require a car seat, which is not provided by the tour provider.\r\n\r\nThis tour can accommodate a maximum of 24 participants.\r\n\r\nFood and drinks with a lid are allowed on the bus. Luggage is not permitted onboard.\r\n\r\nPlease note that the tour remains in Canada and does not cross into the United States. Passports are not required.\r\n\r\nThe tour returns to Toronto at approximately 17:00–18:00.\r\n\r\nPlease note that the tour itinerary is subject to change without notice. \r\n\r\nPlease note that the tour price does not include admission to the following optional attractions. Admission tickets will have to be purchased separately.\r\n\r\nThe approximate admission charges are as follows:\r\nNiagara City Cruises boat tour (summer only): CAD 36\r\nSkylon Tower Observation Deck: CAD 19\r\nJourney Behind the Falls: CAD 29\r\nBird Kingdom: CAD 16\r\nHelicopter ride: CAD 130\n\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\n\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\n\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ",
